 mejl   mira@example.org   Key bindings                                                                                              written to the config file 
┌─ Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Preset: mine (based on fastmail)                                                                                                                             │
│ Mail  List only  Reader only  Global  Compose  Search  Sidebar  Masked  Rules  Settings  Help  Keys  Macros                                                  │
│                                                                                                                                                              │
│  Move                                                                                                                                                        │
│▸   Open                  o  Enter                  Open the conversation or mailbox under the cursor                                                         │
│    Page down             Space  PgDn               Scroll one page down                                                                                      │
│    Page up               PgUp                      Scroll one page up                                                                                        │
│    Half page down        ^d                        Scroll half a page down                                                                                   │
│    Half page up          ^u                        Scroll half a page up                                                                                     │
│  Select                                                                                                                                                      │
│    Select                x                         Select or deselect the conversation                                                                       │
│    Select range          X                         Select from the last selected row to the cursor                                                           │
│    All                   * a                       Select every conversation in the mailbox                                                                  │
│    None                  * n                       Clear the selection                                                                                       │
│  Triage                                                                                                                                                      │
│    Archive               y                         Archive                                                                                                   │
│    Archive, previous     [                         Archive, then go to the previous conversation                                                             │
│    Archive, next         ]                         Archive, then go to the next conversation                                                                 │
│    Trash                 d                         Move to trash (undo with z)                                                                               │
│    Delete permanently, ⋯ #                         Delete permanently, in Trash and Spam only                                                                │
│    Spam                  !                         Report spam                                                                                               │
│    Move to               m  v                      Move to a mailbox                                                                                         │
│    Label                 l                         Add or remove labels                                                                                      │
│    Pin or unpin          s                         Pin or unpin                                                                                              │
│    Read                  . r  I                    Mark as read                                                                                              │
│    Unread                . u  U                    Mark as unread                                                                                            │
│    Pin                   . p                       Pin                                                                                                       │
│    Unpin                 . n                       Unpin                                                                                                     │
│    Mute                  M                         Mute the conversation                                                                                     │
│    Snooze                b 1  b 2  b 3  +4         Snooze (web only in Fastmail)                                                                             │
│  Read and reply                                                                                                                                              │
│    Reply                 r                         Reply to the sender                                                                                       │
│    Reply all             a                         Reply to everyone                                                                                         │
│ Open: Open the conversation or mailbox under the cursor                                                                                                      │
│ A change here applies to the list and the reader.                                                                                                            │
